<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>03 芭提雅｜9/24—26</name><description>9/20 搭 9C8521 到普吉；9/24 搭 DD525 到 DMK，经 A1 与 Mo Chit 转车到芭提雅；9/30 返回杭州。F 为餐厅，住宿为实际入住记录。</description><Style id="airport"><IconStyle><color>ffc95d26</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LineStyle><color>ffc95d26</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="sight"><IconStyle><color>ff848c00</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LineStyle><color>ff848c00</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="stay"><IconStyle><color>ff856957</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LineStyle><color>ff856957</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="pier"><IconStyle><color>ff967808</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LineStyle><color>ff967808</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="bus"><IconStyle><color>ff256199</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LineStyle><color>ff256199</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="food"><IconStyle><color>ff2e58c8</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LineStyle><color>ff2e58c8</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="hotel"><IconStyle><color>ffb95680</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle><LineStyle><color>ffb95680</color><width>3</width></LineStyle></Style><Style id="show"><IconStyle><color>ffad448e</color><scale>1.1</scale><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wh